13	 * is lower-cased and rendered empty when absent; the householdId is rendered empty when the
14	 * owner shares no household. Creation is rejected with 409 only when a new owner's WHOLE
15	 * identityKey equals an existing owner's — so, because the telephone is part of the key, two
16	 * members of the same household with different telephones have different keys and are both
17	 * allowed. See {@link EnsureUniqueOwnerIdentity}.
