10	 * valid address whose domain is not on the disposable-domain blocklist; it is stored and returned
11	 * lower-cased. An absent (null/blank) email is left untouched. A syntactically invalid value
12	 * raises {@link InvalidOwnerEmailException}; a blocklisted domain raises
13	 * {@link DisposableOwnerEmailException}; both make the endpoint respond 400.
